<title>USA: Florida sets $7.96 million bond sale Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Florida sets $7.96 million bond sale Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $7.96 million of state Board of Regents revenue bonds by competitive bid at 10:30 a.m. EDT Wednesday, the state Division of Bond Finance said.</p>
<p>The sale is Board of Regents, University of Central Florida Parking Facility Revenue Bonds, Series 1997.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
